{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/19114", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/19114/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/19114/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/19114/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/issues/19114", "id": 4825842746, "node_id": "I_kwDOAGhaic8AAAABH6SEOg", "number": 19114, "title": "tsdb: Close() errors silently discarded in Querier and blockChunkQuerierForRange cleanup", "user": {"login": "om7057", "id": 127368012, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5d7TA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127368012?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057", "html_url": "https://github.com/om7057", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/om7057/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 0, "created_at": "2026-07-07T06:22:28Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-07T10:56:12Z", "closed_at": "2026-07-07T10:56:12Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I noticed a couple of cleanup paths in `tsdb/db.go` where errors returned from `Close()` are currently ignored.\n\nThis happens in `Querier()` and `blockChunkQuerierForRange()`:\n\n```go\nfor _, q := range blockQueriers {\n    _ = q.Close()\n}\n```\n\nThese cleanup defers run while handling an error path from the surrounding function. If one of the queriers also fails during `Close()`, that information is currently discarded, so the caller only sees the original error.\n\nOne possible improvement would be to preserve both errors using `errors.Join()` so the cleanup failure is not lost, for example:\n\n```go\nif closeErr := q.Close(); closeErr != nil {\n    err = errors.Join(err, fmt.Errorf(\"close querier during cleanup: %w\", closeErr))\n}\n```\n\nThis would keep the original failure while still surfacing any cleanup issues that happen while closing the queriers.\n\n", "closed_by": {"login": "bwplotka", "id": 6950331, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTAzMzE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6950331?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka", "html_url": "https://github.com/bwplotka", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bwplotka/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/19114/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/19114/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}